# Snapshot is truth

`WorkspaceSnapshot` is the system contract and sole source of business truth.

- `WorkspaceSnapshot` is immutable; never mutate in place
- `CurrentSnapshot` is only a pointer to the latest immutable instance
- Do not introduce public APIs or docs for `WorkspaceRuntimeState`, `WatchState`, `PlannerCache`, or similar models that carry business truth
- Runtime caches may exist only as private implementation details
